w('          <Card className="dpe-insight-card p-4"><div className="text-xs font-semibold mb-2 flex items-center gap-1"><Zap className="w-3 h-3 text-red-500"/>Surge Patterns</div><div className="text-[10px] text-muted-foreground">Festival seasons show 2x surge. E-commerce sale events (Big Billion, Great Indian) trigger 2.5x. Pre-plan capacity allocation and communicate surge pricing to enterprise clients 72h ahead.</div></Card>')
w('          <Card className="dpe-insight-card p-4"><div className="text-xs font-semibold mb-2 flex items-center gap-1"><TrendingUp className="w-3 h-3 text-emerald-500"/>Revenue Optimization</div><div className="text-[10px] text-muted-foreground">Implement zone-based pricing for North region where volumes are 25% higher. Cold chain margins can improve 8% by distance-weighted pricing. FTL corridor optimization yields 15% uplift.</div></Card>')
w('        </div>')
